  "segments": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "start_ms": 820,
      "end_ms": 2170,
      "text": "我们来讨论一下"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 2170,
      "end_ms": 5540,
      "text": "就是说限跌啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 10020,
      "end_ms": 14140,
      "text": "现跌我差点写成现月令"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 14639,
      "end_ms": 15839,
      "text": "限跌令"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 16859,
      "end_ms": 19260,
      "text": "就是说这个东西是一个"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 21220,
      "end_ms": 23800,
      "text": "看上去这个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 30340,
      "end_ms": 32920,
      "text": "但实际上在我的观点看来"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 32920,
      "end_ms": 39279,
      "text": "现阶呢事实上会使得这个交易量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 40840,
      "end_ms": 44980,
      "text": "交易量这个大将啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 50840,
      "end_ms": 56190,
      "text": "那么交易量大将会使得这个哎呀"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 56190,
      "end_ms": 58590,
      "text": "我们的观点是啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 58590,
      "end_ms": 63840,
      "text": "我们的观点是持币待购的人会变多啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 64920,
      "end_ms": 68240,
      "text": "就还有一点就是说有大量房产的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 68740,
      "end_ms": 70180,
      "text": "在城市里"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 71740,
      "end_ms": 74140,
      "text": "城城市里有大量房产的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 76520,
      "end_ms": 80930,
      "text": "而且是在一二线城市"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 80930,
      "end_ms": 84980,
      "text": "强二线以上城市有大量房产的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 84980,
      "end_ms": 91560,
      "text": "很多是老师说是啊腐败的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 92580,
      "end_ms": 95259,
      "text": "由于有很大一部分很大一部分"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "start_ms": 97140,
      "end_ms": 103610,
      "text": "啊很大一部分是啊是这个加加入腐败的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "start_ms": 103610,
      "end_ms": 104900,
      "text": "就是腐败的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "start_ms": 104900,
      "end_ms": 108600,
      "text": "腐败的计较利益集团的成员"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "start_ms": 108920,
      "end_ms": 111050,
      "text": "那么限跌呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "start_ms": 111050,
      "end_ms": 113030,
      "text": "那我说如果放开房价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "start_ms": 113030,
      "end_ms": 114260,
      "text": "放开房价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "start_ms": 114260,
      "end_ms": 116380,
      "text": "那这个房价一下跌下去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "start_ms": 116620,
      "end_ms": 119700,
      "text": "那你比如说他有个20套房"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 27,
      "start_ms": 121320,
      "end_ms": 123410,
      "text": "那房价就算跌一半"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 28,
      "start_ms": 123410,
      "end_ms": 125619,
      "text": "跌一半甚至一大半"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 29,
      "start_ms": 127660,
      "end_ms": 130320,
      "text": "他20套房能够套取很多现金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 30,
      "start_ms": 130320,
      "end_ms": 134199,
      "text": "你知道吗啊大概同样能够套取很多陷阱"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 31,
      "start_ms": 134199,
      "end_ms": 136480,
      "text": "因为它的绝对值很大"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 32,
      "start_ms": 137200,
      "end_ms": 142459,
      "text": "有一些腐败的地方上的一些官僚啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 33,
      "start_ms": 142459,
      "end_ms": 146059,
      "text": "腐败官僚他们的家族啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 34,
      "start_ms": 146059,
      "end_ms": 149600,
      "text": "那这个是在一个特殊历史时期"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 35,
      "start_ms": 149600,
      "end_ms": 152280,
      "text": "他们啊他不是20套了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 36,
      "start_ms": 152280,
      "end_ms": 154440,
      "text": "那这30~40套"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 37,
      "start_ms": 154440,
      "end_ms": 155280,
      "text": "50套房了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 38,
      "start_ms": 155280,
      "end_ms": 156090,
      "text": "你知道吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 39,
      "start_ms": 156090,
      "end_ms": 157740,
      "text": "如果不限跌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "start_ms": 157740,
      "end_ms": 159480,
      "text": "交易量大增"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "start_ms": 160220,
      "end_ms": 163990,
      "text": "那么他们是可以把这房子甩掉的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "start_ms": 163990,
      "end_ms": 165780,
      "text": "可以套取现金呢"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "start_ms": 166160,
      "end_ms": 168520,
      "text": "这套取大量现金的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 44,
      "start_ms": 168880,
      "end_ms": 171160,
      "text": "you don't understand大量现金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 45,
      "start_ms": 171160,
      "end_ms": 171940,
      "text": "说难听的在"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 46,
      "start_ms": 171940,
      "end_ms": 173860,
      "text": "在地下钱庄再洗出去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 47,
      "start_ms": 177100,
      "end_ms": 178230,
      "text": "理解吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 48,
      "start_ms": 178230,
      "end_ms": 181929,
      "text": "或者说它可以坏坏啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 49,
      "start_ms": 181929,
      "end_ms": 183099,
      "text": "我据我所知"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 50,
      "start_ms": 183099,
      "end_ms": 186260,
      "text": "最近比较流行的是这个呃"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 51,
      "start_ms": 188240,
      "end_ms": 191620,
      "text": "就是境内抵押啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 52,
      "start_ms": 191620,
      "end_ms": 195149,
      "text": "境内抵押啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 53,
      "start_ms": 195149,
      "end_ms": 199690,
      "text": "然后是在海外接待啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 54,
      "start_ms": 199690,
      "end_ms": 201400,
      "text": "内压外带啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 55,
      "start_ms": 204540,
      "end_ms": 207580,
      "text": "海外接待带美金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 56,
      "start_ms": 208999,
      "end_ms": 211299,
      "text": "有一些银行愿意这样做啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 57,
      "start_ms": 211299,
      "end_ms": 213039,
      "text": "把境内的房产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 58,
      "start_ms": 213039,
      "end_ms": 215559,
      "text": "那他需要强二线以上"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 59,
      "start_ms": 215559,
      "end_ms": 218420,
      "text": "强二线一线的热门地段"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 60,
      "start_ms": 219500,
      "end_ms": 222649,
      "text": "热门地段嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 61,
      "start_ms": 222649,
      "end_ms": 224659,
      "text": "然后抵押了出去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 62,
      "start_ms": 224659,
      "end_ms": 225739,
      "text": "然后拿美金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 63,
      "start_ms": 225739,
      "end_ms": 228180,
      "text": "然后出去就让出去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 64,
      "start_ms": 228500,
      "end_ms": 229760,
      "text": "扔出去抛出去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 65,
      "start_ms": 229760,
      "end_ms": 232820,
      "text": "至少他是家庭成员的一些成员就可以抛出去了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 66,
      "start_ms": 233880,
      "end_ms": 236240,
      "text": "那么为了避免他们可以"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 67,
      "start_ms": 236240,
      "end_ms": 239750,
      "text": "这么轻易地获得这样大量的现金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 68,
      "start_ms": 239750,
      "end_ms": 241640,
      "text": "你说他怎么搞境内抵押"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 69,
      "start_ms": 241640,
      "end_ms": 242900,
      "text": "你说他有几十套房"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 70,
      "start_ms": 242900,
      "end_ms": 244220,
      "text": "他可以把几十套房"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 71,
      "start_ms": 244220,
      "end_ms": 246469,
      "text": "如果说啊不限跌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 72,
      "start_ms": 246469,
      "end_ms": 247849,
      "text": "房价降下去"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 73,
      "start_ms": 247849,
      "end_ms": 251209,
      "text": "这个时候很多城市小资产阶级啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 74,
      "start_ms": 251209,
      "end_ms": 252649,
      "text": "一般的城市居民家庭"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 75,
      "start_ms": 252649,
      "end_ms": 255820,
      "text": "他就会交易量就能继续维持"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 76,
      "start_ms": 256099,
      "end_ms": 258649,
      "text": "现金就会出来啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 77,
      "start_ms": 260599,
      "end_ms": 263719,
      "text": "他再买一些强一线强二线"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 78,
      "start_ms": 263719,
      "end_ms": 266790,
      "text": "所以我们会看到会看到啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 79,
      "start_ms": 266790,
      "end_ms": 271200,
      "text": "就是说强二线和一线城市的热门地段的房价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 80,
      "start_ms": 271200,
      "end_ms": 272460,
      "text": "竟然还是涨的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 81,
      "start_ms": 272460,
      "end_ms": 274380,
      "text": "你知道为什么涨了吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 82,
      "start_ms": 274500,
      "end_ms": 277560,
      "text": "因为他们会买买这个东西之后"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 83,
      "start_ms": 277560,
      "end_ms": 281720,
      "text": "然后抵押了之后借外面的贷款啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 84,
      "start_ms": 281720,
      "end_ms": 284300,
      "text": "然后洗跑跑出去就可以乱了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 85,
      "start_ms": 285740,
      "end_ms": 286690,
      "text": "明白吗"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 86,
      "start_ms": 286690,
      "end_ms": 288220,
      "text": "这个就是很有意思的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 87,
      "start_ms": 288220,
      "end_ms": 289480,
      "text": "就是一些热门第一段"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 88,
      "start_ms": 289480,
      "end_ms": 291190,
      "text": "比如上海一些啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 89,
      "start_ms": 291190,
      "end_ms": 294550,
      "text": "或者说这个深圳的一些热门地段的房子的价格"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 90,
      "start_ms": 294550,
      "end_ms": 295800,
      "text": "甚至还会涨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 91,
      "start_ms": 296120,
      "end_ms": 297640,
      "text": "还会略涨"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 92,
      "start_ms": 298500,
      "end_ms": 302780,
      "text": "略涨的原因就是因为很多它大量处置房产"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 93,
      "start_ms": 302780,
      "end_ms": 304220,
      "text": "把房产好多卖掉"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 94,
      "start_ms": 305120,
      "end_ms": 306760,
      "text": "如果房价狂跌的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 95,
      "start_ms": 306760,
      "end_ms": 308290,
      "text": "就会出现这种状况"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 96,
      "start_ms": 308290,
      "end_ms": 310120,
      "text": "如果二手房狂跌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 97,
      "start_ms": 310120,
      "end_ms": 313079,
      "text": "他们就会把大量的二手房卖掉啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 98,
      "start_ms": 313079,
      "end_ms": 314789,
      "text": "然后去买啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 99,
      "start_ms": 314789,
      "end_ms": 316259,
      "text": "热门地段的房子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 100,
      "start_ms": 316259,
      "end_ms": 319590,
      "text": "然后做抵押拿到的是境外的账"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 101,
      "start_ms": 319590,
      "end_ms": 321270,
      "text": "开了个户头的里面的美金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 102,
      "start_ms": 321270,
      "end_ms": 322440,
      "text": "然后就跑掉了"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 103,
      "start_ms": 324759,
      "end_ms": 325709,
      "text": "没对吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 104,
      "start_ms": 325709,
      "end_ms": 327059,
      "text": "所以在这个意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 105,
      "start_ms": 332590,
      "end_ms": 334380,
      "text": "防止套取"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 106,
      "start_ms": 334780,
      "end_ms": 336940,
      "text": "防止套取啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 107,
      "start_ms": 336940,
      "end_ms": 339190,
      "text": "一下子一下子套取"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 108,
      "start_ms": 339190,
      "end_ms": 340840,
      "text": "可以让一个腐败家族"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 109,
      "start_ms": 340840,
      "end_ms": 343960,
      "text": "这个家族成员还能接受得了的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 110,
      "start_ms": 343960,
      "end_ms": 346300,
      "text": "那么大额的现金啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 111,
      "start_ms": 346300,
      "end_ms": 347460,
      "text": "大额现金"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 112,
      "start_ms": 351740,
      "end_ms": 352940,
      "text": "you understand"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 113,
      "start_ms": 353819,
      "end_ms": 358189,
      "text": "我希望啊就是说好有一些自媒体讲这个线碟"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 114,
      "start_ms": 358189,
      "end_ms": 361020,
      "text": "他没有讲到份上没有减的费用"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 115,
      "start_ms": 361020,
      "end_ms": 362100,
      "text": "当然我们更不要说"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 116,
      "start_ms": 362100,
      "end_ms": 364440,
      "text": "如果说房价完整个崩盘的话"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 117,
      "start_ms": 364440,
      "end_ms": 367439,
      "text": "那么债务危机的引爆啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 118,
      "start_ms": 367439,
      "end_ms": 372269,
      "text": "而且就是说是上下游的房地产是好多环节"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 119,
      "start_ms": 372269,
      "end_ms": 375820,
      "text": "好多工程公司有好多民营的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 120,
      "start_ms": 376120,
      "end_ms": 379060,
      "text": "好多私人承包的啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 121,
      "start_ms": 379060,
      "end_ms": 380860,
      "text": "他不一定都有那个啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 122,
      "start_ms": 380860,
      "end_ms": 382840,
      "text": "他的那个利润率其实都很薄的"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 123,
      "start_ms": 382840,
      "end_ms": 385759,
      "text": "他的债务都会爆掉嗯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 124,
      "start_ms": 385759,
      "end_ms": 387210,
      "text": "所以在这个意义上讲"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 125,
      "start_ms": 387210,
      "end_ms": 388680,
      "text": "当然有一些房"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 126,
      "start_ms": 388680,
      "end_ms": 389910,
      "text": "有一些房产公司"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 127,
      "start_ms": 389910,
      "end_ms": 391590,
      "text": "比如说昆山啊"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 128,
      "start_ms": 391590,
      "end_ms": 393870,
      "text": "最近就有这个降价"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 129,
      "start_ms": 393870,
      "end_ms": 396530,
      "text": "30%卖几百套吧"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 130,
      "start_ms": 396530,
      "end_ms": 398930,
      "text": "他交易量才全市交易量"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 131,
      "start_ms": 398930,
      "end_ms": 401540,
      "text": "昆山这一个地级市才1700多套"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 132,
      "start_ms": 401540,
      "end_ms": 404060,
      "text": "他他自己就降价搞了200多套"
    },
    {
